<overview>
<p>The tariq (plural tariqim) is a large bipedal lizard native to the Outworlds Alliance world of Brasha. Standing just under two meters tall at the shoulder, tariqim are swift, durable, and highly intelligent. Fleshy nutrient deposits near the base of their tails sustain the animals for days in harsh conditions, while a tough, wrinkled hide and transparent inner eyelids protect against sand, grit, and desert exposure. Tariqim rival some BattleMechs and combat vehicles in overland speed, making them exceptional mounts for fast-moving infantry.</p><p>Equipped with laser rifles that offer superior range and armor penetration compared to ballistic weapons, these platoons field one of the most effective personal arms available to conventional infantry, though the weapons are significantly more expensive and require soldiers to carry additional power packs.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype date of generic Laser Rifle weapon
</notes>

